     9	\begin{observation}
    10	\label{obs:sumofws-path}
    11	If $G$ is $k$-contractible to $P_{\ell}$ with witness structure $(W_1,\ldots,W_\ell)$, then $\sum_{i=1}^{\ell} |W_i| \leq k + \ell$.  
    12	\end{observation}
    13	
    14	Observation \ref{obs:sumofws-path} immediately leads to a $\mathcal{O}^*(2^{k-|X|-|Y|})$-time algorithm for the problem when $\ell$ is a constant.
    15	For a clearer analysis of the algorithm, we distinguish two cases:
    16	when $\ell \le 5$, i.e., $n \le k + 5$ and otherwise.
