+        "O(n^2 d) time (202752 coordinate products at the hard preset; measured "
+        "wall-clock is reported by selftest), while constant-weight complement "
+        "lookup takes 2n+t = 200 high-level exact operations but requires exact "
+        "matching across 192 displayed bit strings without tools."
