+"""Verified generator for a Path Contraction witness family from arXiv:2403.06290.
+
+The family uses the split-graph construction in Section 5.2, Theorem 4.  A pair
+of orthogonal constant-weight vectors determines the four witness bags in the
+proof.  Generation is inverse: choose the endpoint pairs first, then draw every
+other vector from the same Hamming layer while excluding further complements.
