+  restarts, and same/reverse row alignment. The cited `O(nm)` chordal algorithm,
+  an ILP encoding, and an external SAT/SMT solver were not run. The exact
+  `O(n^2d)` source-problem scan was run.
+- Requiring several endpoint pairs composes several witnesses for one graph;
+  the paper's literal decision problem asks for one. This keeps the answer short
+  while making a structure-aware random guess negligible.
+- Decoys are conditioned to avoid extra orthogonal pairs. They share the same
+  fixed-weight one-row language as plants, but the intended two-cycle correlation
