/tmp/paper2403.06290.EoncWS/src/cycle.tex:11:If $G$ is $k$-contractible to $C_{\ell}$ with witness structure $(W_1,\ldots,W_\ell)$, then $\sum_{i=1}^{\ell} (|W_i|-1) \leq k$.  
