I’m auditing that implementation rather than overwriting it blindly. I’ve found two concrete reporting issues to fix before rerunning: the declared worst-case answer-token bound is lower than the measured bound, and the current oracle/G9 files contain only quota errors, so they are not valid hardness evidence.
