+The compact route notices that swapping the two 36-coordinate halves is an involution. Every decoy row has its swapped mate on the same side; only the four endpoint rows do not. Two membership passes isolate those exceptions, after which only a 4-by-4 cross-product remains. The counted route is `2n+t^2=276` exact word operations and averaged about `5.1e-5` seconds in the implementation. Without that symmetry, a no-tool solver faces 16,900 shuffled cross-pairs and 72 coordinates per comparison.
 
-The easy regimes deliberately avoided are target `P3` (polynomial time,
